  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "The migration-utils project so far only has a framework for parsing and processing fedora 3 objects.  Now it's time to write some actual migration code.  For some Fedora 3 object properties, the assertions in the DC and RELS-EXT datastreams can be migrated to Fedora 4 properties without extensive design work.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
